===Etymology 2===
A variant of {{m|en|wind}} with simplification of the final consonant cluster; for the vowel quality, compare {{m|en|find}}, {{m|en|mind}}, {{m|en|rind}}.

The same variation of the root ''wind-'' → ''win-'' is also found in dialectal {{cog|gmq|-}}: ''vind-'' → ''vin-''. Also compare {{cog|en|whine}}, {{cog|sv|vina}}.

