|passage=''...''though the '''wash''' may carry surface water for only a few hours a year.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2005|author=Le Hayes|title=Pilgrims in the Desert: The Early History of the East Mojave Desert| passage=Rock Spring '''Wash''' continues a short distance then joins Watson '''Wash'''. Water from Rock Spring comes out of the boulder strewn '''wash''' and disappears into the sand}}
