#* {{quote-journal|en|date=Jan 14 2024|author=Kim Darroch|title=Whoever rules the waves rules the world... The Red Sea crisis will show us if that’s true| url=https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/jan/14/houthi-airstrikes-rishi-sunak-joe-biden-yemen|journal=The Observer|passage=Whoever rules '''the waves''' rules the world...|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20261013073825/https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/jan/14/houthi-airstrikes-rishi-sunak-joe-biden-yemen|archivedate=13 October 2026}}
# {{lb|en|physics}} A moving disturbance in the [[energy]] [[level]] of a [[field]].
#: {{ux|en|Gravity '''waves''', while [[predicted]] by [[theory]] for decades, have been notoriously difficult to detect.}}
